  "description": "Numerics.NET (formerly Extreme Optimization Numerical Libraries for .NET) are a set of libraries for numerical computing and data analysis.\n\nThis is the main package that contains all the core functionality.\n\nFor optimal performance, we strongly recommend also referencing one of the native packages based on Intel's Math Kernel Library (MKL).\n\nSupports .NET 6.0-9.0+, .NET Framework 4.62+, .NET Standard 2.0 on Windows, Linux and Mac.",
